//
// Weight-free check that the decode builder and the weight packer agree on
// each layer class's slab: its size, that it holds the weights the projection
// cores read for that class in their order, and that what it leaves out is
// only zero weights.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/check_per_class_slabs.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: W_DEC {{[0-9]+}} = sum of slabs: True
// CHECK: offsets cumulative: True
// CHECK: layer 0 (arm 7): slab {{[0-9]+}} == w_layer_of, blocks match: True
// CHECK: layer 4 (arm 3): slab {{[0-9]+}} == w_layer_of, blocks match: True
// CHECK: layer 15 (arm 5): slab {{[0-9]+}} == w_layer_of, blocks match: True
// CHECK: layer 19 (arm 1): slab {{[0-9]+}} == w_layer_of, blocks match: True
